	(text "DESIGN NOTES & CALCULATIONS — POWER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 236.855 69.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "356d0bf5-4f1d-4f4b-bca4-93d4e4d6cc85")
	)
	(text "KLJ-5018-5040 = PASSIVE\nbuzzer, no oscillator:\n5 V, 25 Ω, ≥ 90 dB @ 4 kHz.\n\nPB7 = TIM4_CH2 PWM 4 kHz,\n50 % duty (less = quieter).\nIdle LOW. Never leave PB7\nHIGH: 200 mA DC = 1 W,\nthe coil overheats.\n\nD3: freewheels the coil.\nR12 4.7k: Q3 off in reset/\nboot (weak pull-up on PB7)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 129.032 179.324 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6cf3ab3e-ec90-4c5d-8f26-346583d4b7cb")
	)
	(text "Divider (R8 top, R9 bottom):\n\nVsense = V(+5V) × R9 / (R8 + R9)\n       = 5.0 V × 10k / (20k + 10k)\n       = 5.0 V × 0.333\n       = 1.67 V  → PB2 (ADC1_IN10)\n\nFull scale = 3.3 V × 3 = 9.9 V\nResolution = 3.3 V / 4096 × 3 ≈ 2.4 mV per count\n  4.75 V → 1.583 V → ADC ≈ 1965\n  5.00 V → 1.667 V → ADC ≈ 2068\n  5.25 V → 1.750 V → ADC ≈ 2172\n  10.3 V TVS clamp → 3.43 V (< 3.6 V)\n\nC9 filter: source R8 ∥ R9 = 6.7 kΩ\n  τ  = 6.7 kΩ × 100 nF = 0.67 ms\n  fc = 1 / (2π × τ) ≈ 239 Hz\nDivider current = 5 V / 30 kΩ = 0.17 mA\n\nFirmware:\n  VDDA   = 3.0 V × VREFINT_CAL / VREFINT_DATA\n  V(+5V) = ADC / 4095 × VDDA × 3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 176.784 162.814 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "76c25edc-3ddc-41f7-886e-51ff8da3087e")
	)
	(text "Status LEDs (5 V, NPN low-side, GPIO driven)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
